<title>USA: ADFlex names Don Frederick CFO.</title>
<headline>ADFlex names Don Frederick CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHANDLER, Ariz. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADFlex Solutions Inc said Monday it had named Don Frederick as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Officials at the company, which supplies circuit-based interconnect solutions to the computer industry, were not available to comment further.</p>
<p>Frederick was most recently vice president of finance for Flextronics International, ADFlex said in a statement.</p>
